Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your friends have no idea my Stand\NCrush has quite a handy little helper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.14,0:00:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my Stand Talking Mouth works wonders,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,especially when it latches\Nonto your tongue and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.90,0:00:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,forces you to say the exact\Nopposite of what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, that must be the reason why\Nyou can't give us a straight answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever that stand is, it's dragging\NGiorno into that puddle of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,like a ravenous shark ready for dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.40,0:00:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lil' Bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That bloodthirsty beast can\Njump from liquid to liquid!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and somehow take Giorno with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter the amount of liquid there is!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm, that bite was juicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can take Giovanna and his\Nlife-giving stand out of play,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,killing the rest of these perdenti will\Nbe as easy as falling off a swirling log.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.26,0:01:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's going swimmingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.78,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,However, we shouldn't dawdle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.22,0:01:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's choke the life form from\Nthe boy and be done with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.40,0:01:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Our intel says Narancia's stand is\Na bonafide carbon dioxide detector.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.36,0:01:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So you may have well\Nknocked Giorno unconscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.48,0:01:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but given that he's still breathing, your\Nstand is still on Lil' Bomber's radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.10,0:01:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Even your puddle jumping\Nwon't escape his notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing we want is that puny plane\Nfinding us and giving them the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.78,0:01:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd be on us in seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.74,0:01:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I agree, Tiziano.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno will breathe no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.70,0:01:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure of it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.44,0:03:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing is gonna take\NGiorno away and kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.58,0:03:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn this bastardo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of one stand to deal with, there\Nhave been a pair of stands all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.50,0:03:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.24,0:03:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hit this guy for shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And the more I miss my mark, the more\Nchances I'm giving him to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.78,0:03:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to start anticipating his\Nmoves! Where is he? Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.19,0:04:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He can teleport till\Nhe's blue in the face!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.48,0:04:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I stay one step\Nahead of him, I can win!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy's using his radar again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said, he seeks to find and kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.32,0:04:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to halt Giorno's\Nbreathing immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Simmer down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.24,0:04:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's under control, Teets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, attacking Giorno while\Nteleporting isn't exactly a walk in the park!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're in sync! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I hit his neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.03,0:04:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.46,0:04:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,His breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.40,0:04:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not picking up his breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.48,0:04:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't the radar detecting anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He got away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:05:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's a goner now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush has taken him for\Na ride in the sewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have it swim to the canal and\Ndump off the dead weight there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.36,0:05:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec, Squalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.14,0:05:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.09,0:05:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just saying that I'd dump his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.01,0:05:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It was far away, but I know what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Narancia's voice\Nshouting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.06,0:05:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He was screaming about\Nit getting away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.28,0:05:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, Talking Mouse should\Nstill be affixed to his tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.46,0:05:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way the kid should\Nstill be able to speak the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How in the hell did he choke that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He even said the radar\Nwasn't picking anything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.14,0:05:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Move, Squalo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.34,0:05:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to get away from there now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.18,0:05:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.34,0:05:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I guarantee you Giorno's\Nnever gonna breathe again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anyone\Ncan snip out Crush now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it might be overreacting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he said it got away on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it in order to\Nmake you drop your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see he was trying to get\Nyou to stall your next teleportation?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.72,0:05:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,For the life of me, I\Ndon't know how he did it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but the bastards found a\Nway to track your movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno moved into my\Nline of fire on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.44,0:06:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He used the gun smoke to\Ngive me a trail one that'll
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,lead me right back to the\Nenemy It's crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see that stinking guppy a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that hate to ruin your\Nplans But you're no still hasn't been the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,big one if we can revive him in the next\Nfew minutes We might be able to save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.34,0:06:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble, Squalo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already nailed you\Ntwice with that gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,so all he has to do is\Nfollow the smoke back to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.57,0:06:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I drove the scumbag out of the sewer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm stuck, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about as far back\Nas I can go with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:07:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on the replay, our attacker was\Nin the cup on this table at one point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But whatever it was, it left in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Moody Jazz can't transform beyond\Nthis time, and it can't move either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say, Abakyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost like this thing can teleport.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This bastard's got me stumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.62,0:07:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't replay\Nenough to see the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like the videotape\Nhas been severed somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.18,0:07:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.09,0:07:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think Narancia was this clever!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not. It was Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in this mess because he decided to\Nlet himself get mauled by Lil' Bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.70,0:07:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We played into his hands\Nand didn't even know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.22,0:07:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.32,0:07:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get rid of the residue!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.30,0:07:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be because he was\Nhit with stand bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the water can't\Nget this grunt off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.36,0:07:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to find somewhere to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Somewhere his detectors\Nwon't be able to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.90,0:08:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, we're playing this game again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.66,0:08:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, think!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.10,0:08:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This ugly-looking shark thing may have\Ncrazy speed for a long-range stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but from what I've seen, it can't get\Nvery far with one of its teleports.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It can only move two to\Nthree meters per jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He's predicting my moves and\Nhis aim is getting more precise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's slowing down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be his injuries!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Squalo, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more direct hit\Nand then it's bye-bye fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go to hell, you bottom feeder!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a gas leak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all going according\Nto plan, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to your ace shooting,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,the hot water spilt out of the\Npot and put out the flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How's a little bomber gonna shoot\Nme in this gaseous death trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My quick thinking has rendered\Nyour tracking skills a moot point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.56,0:09:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But by all means, fire\Naway and ignite the gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.82,0:09:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing so might not kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but everything around you\Nwill be set ablaze and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.42,0:09:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the resulting carbon dioxide\Nwill nullify your radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Narancia?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to be hesitating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Secure our victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if I can't shoot your ass to hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.16,0:09:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of ways\Nto fillet a homicidal fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.84,0:09:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I finished him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, Mista, the enemy is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.68,0:09:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Abacchio, he has the ability to\Ntransport himself from liquid to liquid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, he's breathing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, I just told the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:10:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've regained control over what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.28,0:10:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gone ahead and released Talking\NMouth from Narancia just as you planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This was a brilliant strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.78,0:10:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You've sustained several injuries,\Nbut I'm sure the boss will be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all the racket, Narancia?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you found the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But Talking Mouth's\Nrelease is only temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Jean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.02,0:10:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the enemy's stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.62,0:10:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.84,0:10:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how you secure\Nvictory, my dear Squalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to complete our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.44,0:10:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go, six bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire away, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My radar's going crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.54,0:11:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna strike and I can't track him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard's gonna kill Giorno all\Nbecause I can't tell the freaking truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.66,0:11:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, you have to look for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.56,0:11:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, you're awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The user.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget the stand and go\Nafter the stand's user.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.32,0:11:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Narancia!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiots,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,why in the hell would\Nyou give me the all-clear
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.56,0:11:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,to shoot when this place\Nis a ticking time bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out! There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy's above you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.10,0:11:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.01,0:11:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's below you, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.14,0:11:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:11:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.58,0:12:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The lies just keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.18,0:12:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt he'll kill Giorno first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he'll start wiping\Nout the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.82,0:12:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The user.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.02,0:12:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget the stand and go after.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.44,0:12:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The stand's user.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno told me to go after the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. The user's injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means he's probably breathing\Npretty heavily at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants me to use my\Nradar to find the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.76,0:12:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.24,0:12:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's gotta be on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.14,0:12:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.32,0:12:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the guy's a long-range stand user\NBut he has to be around here somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.46,0:12:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This fool dies now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.46,0:13:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan's going off without a hitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,With Giorno out of the picture, they\Nwon't be able to play doctor anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now drive the nail in Giorno's coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,His time's come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.78,0:13:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.38,0:13:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not quite at my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.80,0:13:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still have enough juice\Nleft to knock him to kingdom come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look. It's Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.26,0:13:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where exactly is Crush right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.94,0:13:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It went out of the sewer, over by the\Nrestaurant, and is heading toward the canal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't be able to track it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.66,0:13:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely he couldn't be trying\Nto hunt me down, could he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.54,0:13:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My breathing should be untraceable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.48,0:13:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.52,0:13:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm yourself, Squalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.30,0:13:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.80,0:13:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All this is just his feeble\Nattempt at victory. Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,how many pedestrians do you think are\Nwalking around this hundred meter radius?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty? A hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't tell you from anyone\Nelse walking around down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.60,0:14:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he picks up on the\Nunnatural breathing and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,decides to follow that trail\Nall the way back to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to collect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.36,0:14:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the bottom of the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Several people down there are\Nbreathing a lot harder than you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.60,0:14:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,so all you need to do is allow\Nyour breathing to settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If we walk into that piazza like nothing\Nis wrong, everything will work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Fact of the matter is,\Nwe've won this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.24,0:14:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got this in the bag now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.36,0:14:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Flyboy can find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.08,0:14:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you, Stronto!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hide from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.52,0:14:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.43,0:14:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.45,0:14:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to recall Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.04,0:14:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to relax, Squalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think for a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything he's saying is the\Nexact opposite of what he intends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:15:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he found you, which means\Nhe has no clue where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget he's still under my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's really true, why would\Nhe bother saying anything at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious he's trying to get you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,riled up and throw your\Nbreathing off kilter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just calm down, otherwise you'll\Nbe doing exactly what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me when I say that whiny\Nbrat could never single you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is his last-ditch\Neffort to rattle you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Think calmly and get your\Nbreathing under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.75,0:15:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I found you! You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, asshat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finally about to get\Neverything that's coming to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.18,0:15:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, he hasn't found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.80,0:15:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Every word he utters is a big lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You know my power still has hold over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Talking Mouth is\Ngripping his tongue, we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.68,0:15:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Deeds, about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.04,0:15:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.95,0:15:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He sliced off his tongue\Nand he used his own knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,that shouldn't be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this lunatic even\Nconscious, let alone speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this freak show?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.86,0:16:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.77,0:16:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He has another tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.90,0:16:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He used that ladybug.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been that Giorno brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He used his stamp to transform it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss was totally right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.66,0:16:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno had to have made\NNaranja a replacement
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.96,0:16:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,tongue back when they\Nwere both in the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dead for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.62,0:16:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He was monitoring my\Nbreathing the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.98,0:16:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's just trying to trick us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.54,0:16:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If the bastard had actually detected you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.78,0:16:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,he would have made his\Nmove a long time ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many people here, all\Nwith different types of breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Some are shallow while others are deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:17:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Singling someone out should be impossible,\Nbut I've been waiting patiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.54,0:17:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,for a very special moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.74,0:17:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment when you lost your\Ncool and revealed yourself to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.98,0:17:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that you've seen\Nmy hacked-off tongue,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,your agitated breathing is a\Nshining beacon leading right to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you never thought\Nyou'd see this stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.10,0:17:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,hanging like a hunk of meat, which is\Nwhy you're descending into a panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It was well worth the wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I was just about to\Ngive up on looking for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.66,0:17:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Breathing kinda heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What you trying to play dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.44,0:17:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend like you don't hear\Nme a long-haired punk rock reject.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.02,0:17:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane. He\Nmutilated his own body so
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.32,0:17:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,he could find our location\Nthat guy's a maniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.76,0:17:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well now what a surprise I take\Nit the guy next to you is the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,user of that shark stand and I\Ngotta say He's looking pretty pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.20,0:17:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to get that checked out
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Recall crush and do it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.38,0:17:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.42,0:18:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's swimming through the sewer as we\Nspeak and making a beeline for that Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the problem is, there's\Nno water in the square.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.46,0:18:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't attack unless it has\Na body of liquid to leap from.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.24,0:18:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard who tried to\Nsneak away with Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.24,0:18:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Tiziano!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be more than\Nenough for you to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him hell, Squalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.86,0:18:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Things may not have gone as\Nplanned, but one thing remains true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Victories within our grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody can reverse our conquest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.40,0:18:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To hell with the boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He can shove his orders\Nup his reclusive ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:19:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna murder you because it's\Nmy duty as one of the boss's guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.40,0:19:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for you, Tiziano. I'll send\Nthis piece of shit to hell in your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I'm done his friends will die too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll eviscerate them for what they\Ndid. Suffering will be their penance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.62,0:19:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him crush rip his\Nthroat out tear it to shreds!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What you think this would work!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.68,0:19:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You really thought something\Nlike this would take me down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We are getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.34,0:19:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving this place behind with\Nall of our lives intact. Nice knowing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:19:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Volare via!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing waiting for you beyond this
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.74,0:20:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,place is death and despair\Nat the boss's hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.26,0:20:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell keeps these\Ntreasonous dogs going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely they still don't\Nhave hope, even now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's finally breathing again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.84,0:20:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Giorno! Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.70,0:20:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.26,0:21:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I know a Bakio would\Nnever want to admit this,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.06,0:21:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but it was your decision-making that\Npulled us through this whole mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where we'd\Neven be without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You've become our leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There might actually be some hope\Nfor us yet, with you by our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.08,0:21:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.20,0:21:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How long ago did that attack begin?\NFour or five minutes. Let's get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.06,0:21:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,it's safe to say Venice is free of\NHitman from the Family we're in the clear
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,let's head to the airport now we're
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,taking to the skies that'll get us to our
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.98,0:21:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,next destination we're headed for the\Nisle of sardinia If we're to succeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.10,0:21:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it's imperative that we\Nuncover the boss's past.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.10,0:21:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lives depend on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.58,0:22:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Join us. Come on. You'll see us alive
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.82,0:22:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the power. Cause there's a future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we are the fighters Just fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.78,0:22:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For the right. We are the fighters.
